,{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n雇傭兵？"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n雖然細節不明，但是相信我們\n只要保持沉著，一定能夠從容應對。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,0,3]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":3,"offset":11931,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":11956,"body_end":12091,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[22]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&郭嘉\n经过上次的战斗之后，\n我们都惊叹曹丕世子，\n有如主公一般的武勇。\n&曹操\n(這話是褒是貶？)\n嗯，这孩子还得历练历练。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":4,"offset":12091,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":12116,"body_end":12186,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[6]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯渊\n攻城的时候，\n我们这些远距攻击的部队很有效。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":5,"offset":12186,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":12211,"body_end":12338,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[12]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[12,6,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹洪\n我和袁譚在這一關有單挑。\n如果成功觸發的話，\n我可以獲得[C0D100HP]的加成喔。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[12,0,1]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":6,"offset":12338,"title":"玩家切换","body_off":12363,"body_end":12456,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["玩家切换"]},{"op":45,"name":"test_clicked","args":[15]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&许褚\n听说袁谭这个人好像没啥头脑。\n&曹操\n是啊。\n&许褚\n看我打断他的鼻梁吧。"]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":7,"offset"